---
manual: slot.width
lines: [2511, 2513]
testability: visual
display: native
ledger: C8
expect: fail
reason: Lacci's width getter falls back to the parent's width for an unsized slot, and nothing feeds laid-out sizes back from the display (ledgers C8, A4)
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 400, height: 300 do
  flow width: 300 do
    stack width: 100, height: 20
    @rest = stack { stack height: 20 }
  end
end
----------- test code
rest = stack("@rest")
assert_in_delta 200, layout_of(rest).w, 0.5, "a stack in a flow takes the rest of the row"
assert_in_delta 200, rest.width, 0.5, "and width reports that, in pixels"
